   * usually by the individual; admins may invite/create on behalf of others
   * via this endpoint as well.
   *
   * Validation rules enforce uniqueness of username/email, password strength,
   * and valid role assignment. Error responses for duplicate
   * usernames/emails, or invalid role. Successful registration returns
   * complete non-sensitive profile info. Password is accepted in cleartext
   * but must never be returned or logged (only stored as hash).
   *
   * Related: Might be accessed after registration for activating or managing
   * new accounts.
   *
   * @param body User profile, credentials, and initial role assignment for
   *   registration.
