   * The endpoint supports filtering by username, email, role, and account
   * status. Only authorized moderators or administrators can access this
   * endpoint for user management or review purposes. Results include summary
   * info like username, email, role, status, and account creation date, but
   * do not include sensitive data such as passwords.
   *
   * Pagination and sorting are supported for efficient browsing. Relies on
   * proper indexing and role-based access control to ensure performance and
   * security. Errors include permission denied, database errors, and invalid
   * search queries. This endpoint is usually accessed before taking moderator
   * or admin actions on specific users.
