   * Enables authorized updates to a user's record in 'users' table by UUID.
   *
   * Request body includes changes to allow: username, email, biography, role,
   * status, and password (if provided, must be re-hashed and stored
   * securely). Edits restricted to permitted fields only. Only authorized
   * moderators/admins can change roles and statuses; users may edit their own
   * profiles via a different route.
   *
   * Validation ensures unique username/email (ignoring current user), valid
