   *
   * Implements moderation and lifecycle rules: accounts are typically soft
   * deleted (status changed or deletion timestamp set) instead of hard
   * removal, preserving audit/history and relationships to posts.
   *
   * Permission restricted: Only moderators or administrators may use this
